### 3️⃣  New design principles  

| Principle | Why it matters |
|-----------|----------------|
| **Use velocity to decide when to flip the thrust** | When the car is moving left (v < 0) and is still far from the left wall, we should **push left** to increase kinetic energy. When the car is moving right (v > 0) and we have enough speed, we should **push right** to turn that speed into altitude. |
