### 4️⃣  Updated rule‑based strategy (easy to read & edit)

```text
# --------------------------------------------------------------
#  Mountain‑Car – hand‑crafted policy
#  Action a ∈ [‑1.0 , 1.0]
# --------------------------------------------------------------

IF p >= 0.45                     # goal reached
    a = 0.0
ELSE IF p < -0.6                 # far left side – push hard left
    a = -1.0
ELSE IF p < -0.2                 # middle‑left region
    IF v < -0.02                 # moving left → keep pushing left
