| **Fallback: proportional‑control term** | a = kₚ·(0.45 ‑ p) + kᵥ·v, with (kₚ,kᵥ) tuned to give roughly the same piece‑wise decisions as the table below. This gives a compact “continuous” version that can be written as a set of if‑else rules. |

