### 3. Revised (final) strategy  

Below is the polished version that combines the best aspects of the previous attempts and adds a tiny safety margin when we are very close to the goal (to avoid overshooting with a large action that would waste a few extra timesteps).

```text
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Mountain‑Car – deterministic, continuous‑action policy
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
IF position >= 0.45 THEN
    action = 0.0                                   # already at the top
ELSE IF velocity > 0.0 THEN
    # We are already moving right → give full forward thrust.
    # When we are within 0.02 m of the goal we start to taper
    # to avoid a large final action that would add unnecessary penalty.
    IF position >= 0.43 THEN
        # linear taper from +1.0 at 0.43 → 0.0 at 0.45
