| **≈ +89 – +90** (3 runs) | The car reached the goal (position ≥ 0.45) after ≈ 150‑200 steps, received the +100 bonus and only a modest cost for the actions that were used to build speed. The last‑step trace shows a perfectly smooth “ramp‑up” of force from 1.0 → 0.7 as the car approached the hill‑top. |

