*The best performing approach so far is the aggressive‑then‑PD‑fine‑tune scheme.*  
We have distilled it into a compact set of rules that (1) give full thrust while the car is deep in the valley, (2) brake hard when it slips backwards, and (3) switch to a distance‑aware PD controller for a smooth, low‑penalty arrival at the hill‑top. Implement the pseudo‑code above and you should consistently achieve the highest possible episode reward.
